        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "7ce57912ba1db66ec4d698e5fdf210a634e998ac",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 525936916,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I would like to call the DECT dissector from a custom Lua dissector to parse an encapsulated DECT packet:\n```lua\nlocal dect_dissector = Dissector.get(\"dect\")\ndect_dissector:call(tvb(i):tvb(), pinfo, tree)\n```\n\nThis is not an effort to extend the DECT dissector provided by Wireshark (as suggested by the comment) but to make it available for custom dissectors.",
          "author": {
            "id": 897515,
            "username": "patgrosse",
